    "profile_text": {
        "body": "Aurora Innovation, Inc. is a public company headquartered in Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania, traded under the ticker AUR. Its website presents it as a self-driving freight company built around the Aurora Driver, which the company describes as combining hardware and software backed by verifiable AI and as integrating autonomy into a customer's fleet. The site frames the work as delivering self-driving technology safely, quickly, and broadly.\n\nThe site carries customer and partner commentary. One quote describes early results of a pilot program hauling freight autonomously between Fort Worth and El Paso, and describes a hybrid model of Werner professional drivers working alongside the Aurora Driver. Another says the company has partnered with Aurora and that the Aurora Driver is integrated into the Volvo VNL Autonomous. A further quote states that freight volumes are projected to grow five fold between 2010-2050, and another cites consistent performance of the self-driving system over millions of autonomous miles.\n\nThe company's record lists law exposure in Pennsylvania, with a count of 150. No cases are listed against it.",
